00:27:14.550 --> 00:27:16.290
Now we're going to go to the elevator.

621
00:27:16.950 --> 00:27:20.690
Stanley, Daryl, and Phyllis are all heading into work.

622
00:27:20.690 --> 00:27:22.170
They seem excited.

623
00:27:22.570 --> 00:27:24.890
They know Daryl is going to be interviewing today.

624
