And I think Daryl is kind of everybody's favorite choice for new manager.

625
00:27:29.790 --> 00:27:30.290
Yes.

626
00:27:30.510 --> 00:27:36.070
In the extended producer's cut right after this elevator scene, there's a scene with Stanley and Phyllis.

627
00:27:36.210 --> 00:27:42.270
And they're telling the camera operator that they're excited about Daryl being the new manager and they're rooting for him.

628
00:27:42.370 --> 00:27:44.330
