629
00:27:44.330 --> 00:27:50.230
But you kind of understand their energy from the elevator because they go right into this one-on-one with the camera that they're rooting for Daryl.

630
00:27:51.110 --> 00:27:54.890
Daryl is the most capable, most sober choice.

631
00:27:54.890 --> 00:27:57.070
Yes, he's the most level-headed.

632
00:27:57.610 --> 00:27:58.910
Yes, absolutely.

633
00:27:59.530 --> 00:28:03.010
He's also shown himself to have great business ideas.

634
00:28:03.590 --> 00:28:05.010
He is who should be manager.

635
00:28:05.250 --> 00:28:05.370
Yeah.

636
00:28:05.370 --> 00:28:11.250
Now, Craig Robinson did an interview, though, around this time, where he said, I don't want the job.

637
00:28:11.550 --> 00:28:12.090
Oh, yeah?

638
00:28:12.190 --> 00:28:15.510
I like being just Daryl supporting character.

639
00:28:15.510 --> 00:28:21.410
I am not interested in leading conference room scenes and doing what Steve Carell did.

