00:29:00.910 --> 00:29:07.750
He put them everywhere, and I feel like this is kind of like Andy with his slogan and posters.

651
00:29:07.970 --> 00:29:08.970
I'm so sorry.

652
00:29:09.190 --> 00:29:10.010
I'm so sorry.

653
00:29:10.690 --> 00:29:11.130
What?

654
00:29:12.290 --> 00:29:13.090
Plug for Doug.

655
00:29:13.130 --> 00:29:14.170
I can't even say it.

656
00:29:14.210 --> 00:29:14.750
I know.

657
00:29:14.970 --> 00:29:15.430
I know.

658
00:29:15.530 --> 00:29:16.110
Plug for Doug.

659
00:29:16.270 --> 00:29:16.790
I know.

660
00:29:16.790 --> 00:29:19.650
Oh, Jenna, I'll never forget it, because we were like, what are you doing?

