00:29:43.210 --> 00:29:44.150
Oh, boy.

670
00:29:44.830 --> 00:29:46.910
These are not in chronological order.

671
00:29:47.090 --> 00:29:48.730
They are in order of my categories.

672
00:29:49.070 --> 00:29:49.330
Okay.

673
00:29:49.610 --> 00:29:50.310
Here we go.

