00:32:15.490 --> 00:32:15.650
Was he?

744
00:32:15.990 --> 00:32:16.130
Well.

745
00:32:16.610 --> 00:32:20.170
Did we not have the term wet dream back in 1920 whatever?

746
00:32:20.550 --> 00:32:21.350
I don't think so.

747
00:32:21.570 --> 00:32:22.810
I don't think so.

748
00:32:23.370 --> 00:32:25.670
That campaign slogan did not age well.

749
00:32:25.790 --> 00:32:26.270
It did not.

750
00:32:26.330 --> 00:32:26.730
For him.

751
00:32:26.730 --> 00:32:28.390
Well, buckle in.

