00:32:28.890 --> 00:32:35.210
Richard Nixon in 1972 had an official slogan that was, keep it simple, Nixon now.

753
00:32:35.630 --> 00:32:36.070
Okay.

754
00:32:36.070 --> 00:32:43.110
But a few of his supporters and non-supporters had slogans in the hey now category.

755
00:32:43.390 --> 00:32:43.670
Okay.

