762
00:32:55.170 --> 00:32:55.810
Next one.

763
00:32:57.270 --> 00:32:59.850
Don't change dicks in the midst of a screw.

764
00:33:00.250 --> 00:33:01.730
Vote for Nixon in 72.

765
00:33:02.710 --> 00:33:04.450
I don't understand what is happening.

766
00:33:04.710 --> 00:33:05.110
I know.

767
00:33:05.270 --> 00:33:06.250
These are slogans?

768
00:33:06.450 --> 00:33:09.610
These are slogans that caught on with his supporters.

769
00:33:11.090 --> 00:33:12.770
People had a lot of fun with his name.

770
00:33:13.010 --> 00:33:16.330
And now one from folks who did not support Nixon.

771
00:33:17.030 --> 00:33:22.410
