1645
01:11:33.530 --> 01:11:35.450
Maybe I'll just pick a name out of the hat.

1646
01:11:35.710 --> 01:11:37.110
Oh, that doesn't go over well.

1647
01:11:37.310 --> 01:11:39.770
Some Stanley sass is about to happen.

1648
01:11:39.770 --> 01:11:42.150
He says, the hell you will.

1649
01:11:42.350 --> 01:11:45.190
I worked for the last boss for 15 years.

1650
01:11:45.390 --> 01:11:48.010
According to my doctor, I don't have another 15 years.

1651
