If I want to keep up the same dietary and sexual lifestyle, which I intend to.

1652
01:11:52.450 --> 01:11:52.970
Yes.

1653
01:11:53.430 --> 01:11:55.570
My next boss will be my last boss.

1654
01:11:55.910 --> 01:11:57.190
He'll be at my funeral.

1655
01:11:57.930 --> 01:11:58.070
Yeah.

1656
01:11:58.630 --> 01:11:59.930
Meredith is ticked off, too.

1657
01:12:00.150 --> 01:12:03.610
She's like, you pick a crappy boss, you're responsible for my crappy life.

1658
01:12:03.750 --> 01:12:05.010
And then Oscar.

1659
01:12:05.530 --> 01:12:06.370
Oscar's annoyed.

1660
01:12:06.930 --> 01:12:07.370
Yeah.

1661
01:12:07.370 --> 01:12:15.510
And then Ryan says, maybe, maybe Jim should take a day off from his gym shtick and try

1662
01:12:15.510 --> 01:12:17.410
caring about something for a change.

1663
01:12:18.110 --> 01:12:18.270
Yeah.

1664
01:12:18.470 --> 01:12:21.050
That was my second favorite line in the whole episode.

1665
01:12:21.290 --> 01:12:24.970
Little advice, take a day off from the whole gym shtick.

1666
01:12:25.210 --> 01:12:25.570
Yeah.

1667
01:12:25.610 --> 01:12:26.670
And then he calls him James.

1668
01:12:26.930 --> 01:12:29.030
